#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:6
msgid "Channel Summaries"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:8
msgid ""
"Channel Summaries help you catch up on activity in the current channel "
"without manually reading every post. Use the **Ask Agents about this "
"channel** button in the channel header to summarize recent activity, "
"focus on a time range, or enter a prompt about the conversation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:10
msgid ""
"Channel Summaries require a license. See the [license requirements"
"](/administration-guide/configure/agents-admin-guide.html#license-"
"requirements) for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:12
msgid "Use Channel Summaries"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:14
msgid "To open Channel Summaries:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:16
msgid "Open the channel you want to analyze."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:17
msgid "Select **Ask Agents about this channel** in the channel header."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:18
msgid ""
"Choose the agent you want to use in **GENERATE WITH:** if multiple agents"
" are available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:19
msgid "Select one of the available actions, or enter a prompt."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:21
msgid ""
"The response is generated in the **Agents** pane, and only you can view "
"it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:23
msgid "Available actions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:25
msgid "Channel Summaries provide several ways to analyze the current channel:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:27
msgid ""
"**Summarize unreads**: Summarize messages posted since you last viewed "
"the channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:28
msgid "**Summarize last 7 days**: Summarize recent discussion from the last week."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:29
msgid "**Summarize last 14 days**: Summarize discussion from the last two weeks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:30
msgid ""
"**Select date range to summarize**: Summarize activity between specific "
"start and end dates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:31
msgid ""
"**Prompt**: Enter a prompt such as \"What decisions were made in this "
"channel?\" or \"List the open action items from this discussion.\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:33
msgid "Enter a prompt"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:35
msgid ""
"Use the text box in the popover to enter a targeted prompt about the "
"current channel. For example, you can prompt an agent to:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:37
msgid "Identify decisions, risks, or blockers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:38
msgid "Extract action items and owners."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:39
msgid "Explain the status of a project or incident."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:40
msgid "Summarize a discussion for someone joining late."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:42
msgid ""
"This helps you move beyond a general summary when you need a specific "
"answer based on channel context."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:44
msgid "Choose the right entry point"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:46
msgid "Mattermost Agents offers more than one way to summarize channel activity:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:48
msgid ""
"Use **Ask Agents about this channel** when you want to analyze the "
"current channel with flexible options such as entering a prompt, date "
"ranges, or recent activity summaries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:49
msgid ""
"Use **Ask AI** at the **New Messages** line when you want to quickly "
"summarize unread messages in a channel. See [Summarize unread "
"channels](../user_guide.md#summarize-unread-channels)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:51
msgid "Tips"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:53
msgid ""
"Choose the agent that best matches your task, such as a general assistant"
" or a more specialized team agent."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:54
msgid ""
"Ask narrow questions when you want a focused answer, such as decisions, "
"risks, next steps, or customer feedback."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:55
msgid ""
"Use date ranges to reduce noise in busy channels and focus on a specific "
"period."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/features/channel_summaries.md:57
msgid ""
"Contact your system admin if **Ask Agents about this channel** is not "
"available in your Mattermost workspace."
msgstr ""

